{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1018189-dreamer-questions","id":1018189,"title":"Dreamer questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-16T12:53:38-08:00","id":1018189,"title":"Dreamer questions","content":"What happens if you Muse / Ravage / Rhapsodize / Rend [Dauntain Ravaging] / Reap [literally scaring someone to death and gathering Glamour] Nephandi, Technocrats and Marauders? Do you gain dark Glamour? Nightmare Glamour? Is it tainted? On one hand, you're targeting things that need to die -- Nephandi, Technocrats -- but they're still Dreamers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T16:58:48-08:00","id":1018618,"title":"","content":"Something bad, I would think. The Technocrats don't have to be bad guys, though. They want the best for mankind, they just have a different idea of what is good for man and the world in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10179-shadryx","name":"shadryx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T17:59:05-08:00","id":1018629,"title":"","content":"The few Technocrats we know are okay. They aren't Autumn People. We wouldn't do anything other than Muse them. I was just idly curious about what would occur if you Ravaged one. Or Rhapsodized one. Or you know, ripped Glamour out of a Nephandus. I imagine Marauders might be easier to Muse, if their worldview and ours happened to mesh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T15:46:59-08:00","id":1019459,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the Technocrats are like cosmic traffic cops, irritating when they stop us but still a good idea. The nephandi I wouldn't touch, they're too slimy even for the Sluagh. The marauders on the other hand might be a huge fount of glamour to the point of overflow. If there were such a thing as too much Glamour, it might be them!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10179-shadryx","name":"shadryx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-20T15:14:04-08:00","id":1019998,"title":"","content":"The Technocrats are Dreamers ? I see them as being utterly banal people because they try to enforce a banal paradigm on humanity. But know you say it... It's not because they are Science that they are Banal. I suppose one can bring wonder to his techno-stuff. But I thought it was the area of the Sons of Ether and Virtual Adept...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12595-nitenshi","name":"Nitenshi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-21T15:17:40-08:00","id":1020673,"title":"","content":"I think you are right. Most technocrats want safety and comfort for mankind and tend to oppose that which is whimsical, because it could create a trend they cannot control. Marauders are chaos incarnate. Taking glamour from them might send you swiftly spiraling into deep Bedlam.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10179-shadryx","name":"shadryx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-21T16:32:33-08:00","id":1020704,"title":"","content":"We bent the rules so we could all play together. Anything that gets in the way of fun gets tossed. Plus one of them is a Marauder and another one is an anurana werefrog. Or a chulorviah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-26T12:20:03-08:00","id":1022420,"title":"","content":"Nephandi? Throw in some Nightmare dice (maybe one per Glamour point). Marauder? Double the Glamour gained and check for Bedlam. Technocrats? Depending on their Banality, maybe add a point or two of temporary Banality to the fae's own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-26T16:11:10-08:00","id":1022504,"title":"","content":"At most, the Technocrats have Banality seven. So I'm guessing a normal amount of Glamour. Yay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1973-saint-michael","name":"Saint Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1973_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"183"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-27T00:22:03-08:00","id":1022643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saint Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1018189-dreamer-questions?p=1022504#post1022504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At most, the Technocrats have Banality seven. So I'm guessing a normal amount of Glamour. Yay.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah. Some of them are 9-10. Remember not every Technocrat is a mage. Many are just humans doing very banal things. The Enlightened ones of course are more Glamorous.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}